se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-026886f9-9eb1-440d-b16c-4b7b02fbf1e2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9ed9421c-e4e3-4d4a-b36a-f31bf59033a1\">기간 한정 Pick Up 모집 이벤트가</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-de593005-fbc6-40c0-8391-bb2de511e7dd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e3e399c5-70ed-4765-a160-9f5a26b70dfc\">진행될 예정이니 많이 기대해 주세요!​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e7c11b77-848a-4178-838a-8f1564780180\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0dd63db8-dead-4d4f-8922-05b37b2b53a0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-524c9fea-0bba-4205-87b9-5f4a7e80ac9a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-de413ac1-2eb7-46a6-8a69-703c4da12094\"><b>✔️ Pick Up 모집 기간</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d6e59596-c59d-4978-948a-ccf89f2a11c8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e135bd76-26cf-4237-bbf4-9b41157d2376\">- 2/12(목) 점검 완료 후 ~ 3/12(목) 4:59</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3e35a853-5218-41b2-a2e9-32a651d2fc0a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d20b7fb7-82d6-45e7-b317-258074ca9158\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b49c35a4-0dd7-4d0d-b2e2-a969eee8ca29\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-562a6ca7-084d-46cd-96c3-ca9227026963\">※ 「니시키기 치사토」는 기간 한정 Pick Up 모집 기간이 종료된 후 일반 모집, 신규 지휘관 전용 모집, 일반 모집(튜